"preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL39584138M/Ibn_Al-Arabi's_Fusus_Al-Hikam","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL81092A","name":"Binyamin Abrahamov"}],"isbn_13":["9781315736655"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"lc_classifications":["BP189.26.I2513 2015"],"pagination":"194","publish_date":"2015","publishers":["Taylor & Francis Group"],"source_records":["bwb:9781315736655"],"subjects":["Sufism"],"title":"Ibn Al-Arabi's Fusus Al-Hikam","subtitle":"An Annotated Translation of the Bezels of Wisdom","full_title":"Ibn Al-Arabi's Fusus Al-Hikam An Annotated Translation of the Bezels of Wisdom","works":[{"key":"/works/OL21292882W"}],"key":"/books/OL39584138M","latest_revision":1,"revision":1,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-09-18T02:15:00.903958"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-09-18T02:15:00.903958"}}},"ISBN:9781138831315":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9781138831315","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL28830376M/Ibn_Al-Arabi's_Fusus_Al-Hikam","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL28830376M/Ibn_Al-Arabi's_Fusus_Al-Hikam","details":{"publishers":["Taylor & Francis Group"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"subtitle":"An Annotated Translation of the Bezels of Wisdom","source_records":["bwb:9781138831315","marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part41.utf8:188500055:1133","marc:marc_columbia/Columbia-extract-20221130-031.mrc:168598706:4849","marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_007.bib.mrc:34162523:5264"],"title":"Ibn Al-Arabi's Fusus Al-Hikam","lccn":["2014032194"],"number_of_pages":204,"isbn_13":["9781138831315"],"lc_classifications":["BP189.26.I2513 2015","BP189.26 .I2513 2015"],"publish_date":"2015","key":"/books/OL28830376M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL81092A","name":"Binyamin Abrahamov"}],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL21292882W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"subjects":["Sufism"],"oclc_numbers":["905600016","886673123"],"description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Ibn al-Arabi's Fusus al-Hikam is a translation of one of the most important works written on Islamic Mysticism. Muhyi al-Din Ibn al-Arabi (1165-1240) is deemed the greatest mystic of Islam and his mystical philosophy has attracted the attention of both Muslims and non-Muslims from his time to the present day. Believing that the world is the self- manifestation of God, he claimed that all religions are equal and that the perfect human being is he who knows all the religious phenomena in the world. Fusus al-hikam examines the singular characteristics of twenty seven prophets of Islam and constitutes the best summary of Ibn al-Arabi's thought. The translation of these twenty seven chapters is preceded by an introduction that explains the main ideas of Ibn al-Arabi and is accompanied by explanatory notes to the text. Providing an easily accessible translation of one of the greatest mystics of Islam, Ibn al Arabi' Fusus al-Hikam is essential reading for students, scholars and researchers of Islamic Philosophy, Mysticism and Islamic Mysticism in particular."},"latest_revision":4,"revision":4,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2020-08-16T17:57:20.421826"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2025-06-01T07:52:24.057543"}}},"ISBN:9780367871482":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9780367871482","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL62463373M/Ibn_Al-Arabi's_Fusus_Al-Hikam","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL62463373M/Ibn_Al-Arabi's_Fusus_Al-Hikam","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL81092A","name":"Binyamin Abrahamov"}],"dewey_decimal_class":["297.4"],"isbn_13":["9780367871482"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"number_of_pages":204,"publish_date":"2019","publishers":["Taylor & Francis Group"],"source_records":["bwb:9780367871482"],"title":"Ibn Al-Arabi's Fusus Al-Hikam","weight":"0.382","subtitle":"An Annotated Translation of the Bezels of Wisdom","full_title":"Ibn